    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Wake Up, Girls!",
        "jpn": "Wake Up, Girls!"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Green Leaves Entertainment is a tiny production company on the verge of going out of business. The president Tange hatches an idea of producing an idol group. On the brash president's orders, the manager Matsuda heads out to scout raw talent.",
        "jpn": "Green Leaves Entertainmentは、廃業寸前の小さな制作会社です。 丹下社長はアイドルグループを作るという発想をかき立てる。 率直な大統領の命令で、松田マネージャーは生の才能をスカウトするために向かいます。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Wake Up, Girls! New Chapter",
        "Wake Up, Girls! Shin Shou",
        "Wake Up, Girls! Shinshou",
        "Wake Up, Girls！新章"
    ],
